                                "sense_id": "8e11a8a3-3d82-3a42-ab5b-4985d2bee6a5",
                                "text": "This I learnt was the captain's dubash, a native man acting as general steward who provides every household article as well as of merchandise, and engages all inferior servants."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e7585bfa-9d80-4a4e-ac6f-ef646cf69872",
                                "sense_id": "8e11a8a3-3d82-3a42-ab5b-4985d2bee6a5",
                                "text": "[…] inhabitants complain to him, and as he does not understand the language he is obliged to call for his dubash to interpret what they say; […]"
                            }
                        ]
